 Info
 ⍞←'This is Tatin version ',(2⊃##.Registry.Version),' from ',(3⊃##.Registry.Version),⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'A) You may initialize the WS for acting either as a Tatin server or a Tatin client but NOT both.',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'   In order to act as a client execute:',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'         #.Tatin.Admin.Initialize_Client',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'   In order to act as a server execute:',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'         #.Tatin.Admin.Initialize_Server',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'B) Compiling a new version is not only required before publishing but also before executing',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'   the client''s test suite because it executes Tatin''s API functions within ⎕SE as well as',⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←'   user commands, so they should be up to date.',⎕UCS 10
